[{:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "q-34062"] :question/problem "Given that $Q(4,0,-3)$ lies on the plane $Π:r\\cdot ⟨1,-4,5⟩=-11$, find the shortest distance from $P(-2,1,-1)$ to $Π.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨4,0,-3⟩-⟨-2,1,-1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨6,-1,-2⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the equation of a plane, we get a normal vector $n=⟨1,-4,5⟩.$\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|6\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot (-4)+(-2)\\cdot 5|}{\\sqrt{{1}^{2}+(-4)^{2}+{5}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|6+4-10|}{\\sqrt{1+16+25}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\,0\\,|}{\\sqrt{42}} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the point $P$ lies on the plane $Π.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "q-80115/selection/0b264a929df91f183c31537acf560edd2114ab983879cbe61ea3aed58b55bda9" :answer/id #uuid "077d3150-975a-51a9-9216-1a486213b1d6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "55" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80115/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "243ec44e-50c3-5f68-80bc-c86f4f16c78c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80115/selection/c961310a3bc781950858cd88cfba7959d0d487b62af56e846c2cdeea9c7b843b" :answer/id #uuid "a2c364af-a272-50a6-b30f-494f110bb9e4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80115/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" :answer/id #uuid "c801d42b-7f0d-5c60-b475-a966bee05aa0" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "15" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80115/selection/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59" :answer/id #uuid "daf22698-4613-5982-8786-c0d5ba6cad6e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{5}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80115/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ab6f04e5-e374-58d3-a929-8a7e744125e1" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-80115/selection/c961310a3bc781950858cd88cfba7959d0d487b62af56e846c2cdeea9c7b843b" :answer-field/choices ["q-80115/selection/0b264a929df91f183c31537acf560edd2114ab983879cbe61ea3aed58b55bda9" "q-80115/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-80115/selection/c961310a3bc781950858cd88cfba7959d0d487b62af56e846c2cdeea9c7b843b" "q-80115/selection/66dedd51c696580d351ab6a45c1c63cb495081ccf219c3c3c62f1d90fbeb5a49" "q-80115/selection/219347bb4a6f51134d7f5aff5da33544f44afee934064621ebff9cf9e335ee59"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-80115" :question/id #uuid "f7b651ee-2f62-5743-a764-86bdae6d7be2" :question/math-academy-id "q-80115" :question/problem "Find the shortest distance between the point $P(-2,11,1)$ and the plane $Π$ with equation $r\\cdot ⟨2,-5,4⟩=20.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we need to find a point on the plane. If $r=⟨x,y,z⟩,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨2,-5,4⟩ & =20 \\\\ 2x-5y+4z & =20 \\\\ 4z & =20-2x+5y \\\\ z & =5-\\frac{1}{2}x+\\frac{5}{4}y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting $x=2$ and $y=4,$ we get \n\n$$\nz=5-\\frac{1}{2}(2)+\\frac{5}{4}(4)=9.\n$$\n\nSo, the point $Q(2,4,9)$ lies on the plane. \n\nNow, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨2,4,9⟩-⟨-2,11,1⟩ \\\\  & =⟨4,-7,8⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the equation of a plane, we get a normal vector $n=⟨2,-5,4⟩.$\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|(4)\\cdot 2+(-7)\\cdot (-5)+8\\cdot 4|}{\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+(-5)^{2}+{4}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|8+35+32|}{\\sqrt{4+25+16}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|75|}{\\sqrt{45}} \\\\  & =5\\sqrt{5}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-80115/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5a50c5f1-fbda-5c87-afa2-32495c69c18d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-80115"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-80116/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" :answer/id #uuid "9ab2e938-3240-5910-a569-6e0752fb1f64" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "0" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80116/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" :answer/id #uuid "f97ebe4d-2393-5387-9326-7180f29b6188" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "11" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80116/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" :answer/id #uuid "95a80207-5a88-5a47-add0-733d1b6be8a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "10" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80116/selection/dc76daf37192742de0b93cd546a462529f123cb384979201f2cbb9c3187801ac" :answer/id #uuid "d53a08f1-40ce-5e22-8590-5b3eacccd857" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{109}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80116/selection/4ef0fcc340e40ad6bcef1c832215cd28abf240aabeed43296dfece28d20d1935" :answer/id #uuid "ade8f885-849c-50b8-8f22-88154f1240d4" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "\\sqrt{10}" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-80116/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "86fae567-a48e-54ef-bd62-a956ccedea23" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-80116/selection/dc76daf37192742de0b93cd546a462529f123cb384979201f2cbb9c3187801ac" :answer-field/choices ["q-80116/selection/d971375f57c56d8a55a09f2b892e108787b055ceeadf005d7beed73e388cc467" "q-80116/selection/478cbf1ea235fbfb5b60a0837fffa0a678f83a3bcb8f958a024b0760ea2175ce" "q-80116/selection/56019ff80d11d678dbd5eca83c729f420f1b6a8ad4259032846618d6b48aa0bc" "q-80116/selection/dc76daf37192742de0b93cd546a462529f123cb384979201f2cbb9c3187801ac" "q-80116/selection/4ef0fcc340e40ad6bcef1c832215cd28abf240aabeed43296dfece28d20d1935"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-80116" :question/id #uuid "ad6c1785-45cd-5cbd-9ed7-53bd428209fc" :question/math-academy-id "q-80116" :question/problem "Find the shortest distance between the point $P(8,-6,5)$ and the plane $Π$ with equation $r\\cdot ⟨-8,6,3⟩=24.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we need to find a point on the plane. If $r=⟨x,y,z⟩,$ we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}⟨x,y,z⟩\\cdot ⟨-8,6,3⟩ & =24 \\\\ -8x+6y+3z & =24 \\\\ 3z & =24+8x-6y \\\\ z & =8+\\frac{8}{3}x-2y.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSetting $x=3$ and $y=1,$ we get \n\n$$\nz=8+\\frac{8}{3}(3)-2(1)=14.\n$$\n\nSo, the point $Q(3,1,14)$ lies on the plane. \n\nNow, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨3,1,14⟩-⟨8,-6,5⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-5,7,9⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the equation of a plane, we get a normal vector $n=⟨-8,6,3⟩.$\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|(-5)\\cdot (-8)+7\\cdot 6+9\\cdot 3|}{\\sqrt{(-8)^{2}+{6}^{2}+{3}^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|40+42+27|}{\\sqrt{64+36+9}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|109|}{\\sqrt{109}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{109}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-80116/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5a50c5f1-fbda-5c87-afa2-32495c69c18d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-80116"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129120/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" :answer/id #uuid "50a9c101-6040-5f1b-801d-2fbfe20bc200" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "3" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129120/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "ab946482-d5f1-5b8b-afec-fe7af533a64c" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129120/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer/id #uuid "63bf3027-e5e3-5155-a2ae-b3868a2b239d" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "2" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129120/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" :answer/id #uuid "c18299b4-08b7-5050-bdf0-67673df597ba" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "1" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129120/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03" :answer/id #uuid "44c339db-5776-5817-80dc-407ee9a16d6e" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "4" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129120/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "4a8dd7df-6ab1-5986-87a4-4cf5c94f9847" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129120/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" :answer-field/choices ["q-129120/selection/62a6fd1cf465955cead36d661dcbed2f93206049c15d21d7eebcabb802d1aa54" "q-129120/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-129120/selection/954f2b2ecf089f1c43903a74f4575cff67408acc792f8a71c271fa3076456a3b" "q-129120/selection/ad06fa8bb7e77edd4098e00237718855c96ba589745d004ae1aed5be17e6549c" "q-129120/selection/be9eb51cc2f690a7d5b4aa400428edabf5a5d631a176c92b7f40bdd47725ed03"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129120" :question/id #uuid "780bb8b5-f350-5f18-b702-f18d3b60c284" :question/math-academy-id "q-129120" :question/problem "Given that $Q(5,-1,9)$ lies on the plane $Π:r\\cdot ⟨3,-6,-2⟩=3$, find the shortest distance from $P(7,-2,8)$ to $Π.$" :question/worked-solution "First, we find\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨5,-1,9⟩-⟨7,-2,8⟩ \\\\  & =⟨-2,1,1⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFrom the equation of a plane, we get a normal vector $n=⟨3,-6,-2⟩.$\n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|(-2)\\cdot 3+1\\cdot (-6)+1\\cdot (-2)|}{\\sqrt{{3}^{2}+(-6)^{2}+(-2)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|-6-6-2|}{\\sqrt{9+36+4}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|-14|}{\\sqrt{49}} \\\\  & =\\frac{14}{7} \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-129120/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "5a50c5f1-fbda-5c87-afa2-32495c69c18d"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129120"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-129161/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" :answer/id #uuid "232c692e-7823-5c98-ba0c-b7c3dacc80a1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "7" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129161/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer/id #uuid "94ef919a-823b-59ff-afad-ca74c38e0ba1" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "9" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129161/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" :answer/id #uuid "03f99c4d-1138-5e87-af97-3005e7eb72be" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "5" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129161/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" :answer/id #uuid "740278ce-6c61-53ac-8e2c-70bd02d4dbf7" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "6" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129161/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af" :answer/id #uuid "1dcf7597-a454-509c-8439-d34e5faa06ab" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "8" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-129161/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "7da30b26-2c11-5baa-adf7-a5c00c13bd1f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-129161/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" :answer-field/choices ["q-129161/selection/7f2aea1619f9c4cbe5384e0826442d82ebdb1ac614452244ced54b63c0c77efe" "q-129161/selection/303632d9519e4b7e53f9af56aad03bb866b8b5ede58a0b8b2cb848d575460c53" "q-129161/selection/eadb4f132857861f1e64373661b9a01bc3625cc86bcffcc32659fc4899904fe0" "q-129161/selection/a0e0e68f25b8b46aafef3b74aff7beff7fddc6de5bf36921680b04c7b0e6ffaa" "q-129161/selection/7845f5bf94d2cfe99f73682a34529955af46f8f5d6f59bb198a07cbc245060af"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-129161" :question/id #uuid "dbfa5b10-3396-56ab-981b-810a79db88a8" :question/math-academy-id "q-129161" :question/problem "Find the shortest distance between the point $P(-7,2,3)$ and the plane $Π$ with equation $4x+2y-4z=18.$" :question/worked-solution "Let's start by picking a point on the plane. To do that, we simply substitute some concrete values for $x$ and $y$ into the equation and solve for $z.$ Let's choose $x=2$ and $y=1$ (though it doesn't really matter what values we choose). Solving for $z,$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}4x+2y-4z & =18 \\\\ 4(2)+2(1)-4z & =18 \\\\ -4z & =8 \\\\ z & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, we get the point $Q(2,1,-2)$ which lies on the plane.\n\nComputing $\\overset{\\to }{PQ},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\overset{\\to }{PQ} & =⟨2,1,-2⟩-⟨-7,2,3⟩ \\\\  & =⟨9,-1,-5⟩.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe also need a normal vector to the plane. For any Cartesian equation of a plane $ax+by+cz=d,$ the normal vector is $n=⟨a,b,c⟩.$ So, for the plane $Π,$ we have $n=⟨4,2,-4⟩.$ \n\nFinally, the shortest distance from the point $P$ to the plane $Π$ is the absolute value of the scalar projection of $\\overset{\\to }{PQ}$ onto the normal vector of the plane:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}d & =|{\\text{comp}}_{n}\\,\\overset{\\to }{PQ}| \\\\  & =\\frac{|\\overset{\\to }{PQ}\\cdot n|}{|n|} \\\\  & =\\frac{|9\\cdot 4+(-1)\\cdot 2+(-5)\\cdot (-4)|}{\\sqrt{{4}^{2}+{2}^{2}+(-4)^{2}}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|36-2+20|}{\\sqrt{16+4+16}} \\\\  & =\\frac{|54|}{\\sqrt{36}} \\\\  & =\\frac{54}{6} \\\\  & =9.\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["q-129161/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "489887a0-7013-5fb2-8f16-d18616196b0f"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-129161"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]}]
